{"version":1,"content":"<p>煙韌拉絲!4款口味:大推薄荷朱古力</p>\n<h2>森林麵包推出韓國大熱脆皮朱古力千層麻糬</h2>\n<p>森林麵包由11月2日起新推出韓國大熱脆皮生朱古力千層麻糬，$38件，提供4款口味：香橙朱古力、薄荷朱古力、士多啤梨朱古力、抹茶朱古力。鮮奶麻糬皮用糯米粉同木薯粉製成，煙韌又拉絲；內餡是生朱古力 ganache，面層再灑可可粉，做到外脆煙韌的質感。官方建議當脆皮雪條咁食，買完約 15 分鐘內食最爽脆！</p>\n<p>森林麵包 @theforestbakerylokwah<br/>\n售價$38／件，11 月 2 日：香橙朱古力、薄荷朱古力、士多啤梨朱古力、抹茶朱古力；11 月 9 日推出新口味鳳仙（外皮香蕉朱古力；入餡芒果醬＋白朱古力＋忌廉 ganache）<br/>\n首輪分店：觀塘 The Angle、太古城、圓方，每日限量，售完即止；每人限購兩件</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<p> <figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17935992235716332_8466896646ae826f7b5cac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17935992235716332_8466896646ae826f7b5cac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922469963441_7494204336ae826f8d62db.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922469963441_7494204336ae826f8d62db.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922615455305_17246618056ae826fa5d38c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922615455305_17246618056ae826fa5d38c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922767483830_4772829586ae826fbc4359.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922767483830_4772829586ae826fbc4359.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfOZgF8k9n2/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%96%b0%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1-%e6%a3%ae%e6%9e%97%e9%ba%b5%e5%8c%85-%e8%84%86%e7%9a%ae%e9%ba%bb%e7%b3%ac%e6%9c%b1%e5%8f%a4%e5%8a%9b-ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8-ww01-3534402/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港食到韓國脆皮麻糬朱古力!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期</a>.</p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:14.030868+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":592,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:38:55.786726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:22.231785+00:00","content_hash":"68862c67cbc8b0cb0206c3e2c93f9cddfbf92622c3ab75fe947799c040670014","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 404","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}